From: CreckerROM <creckerrom@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] Allow the target document scan inference bridge

DeepDocRectify loads the target DLInterface bridge dynamically. Declare the
existing public library so updated Camera installations can also load it.

---
--- a/AndroidManifest.xml
+++ b/AndroidManifest.xml
@@ -578,6 +578,7 @@
         <uses-native-library android:name="libQREngine.camera.samsung.so" android:required="false"/>
         <uses-native-library android:name="libRectify.camera.samsung.so" android:required="false"/>
         <uses-native-library android:name="libDocRectifyWrapper.camera.samsung.so" android:required="false"/>
+        <uses-native-library android:name="libDLInterface_aidl.camera.samsung.so" android:required="false"/>
         <uses-native-library android:name="libSDKRecognitionOCR.spenocr.samsung.so" android:required="false"/>
         <uses-native-library android:name="libSDKMoireDetector.spenocr.samsung.so" android:required="false"/>
         <uses-native-library android:name="libStride.camera.samsung.so" android:required="false"/>
